retroarch (1.21.0+ds1-1) plucky; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: v1.21.0
  * Add option to mute audio during gameplay rewinds.
  * Fix failure to launch when Pipewire systemd user service is stopped.
  * Fix PipeWire latency setting and microphone handling interactions.
  * Add PipeWire and FFmpeg camera drivers.
  * Include achievement state in netplay save states.
  * Allow –entryslot CLI option flag to fall back to normal states.
  * Fix save state auto-incrementing behavior.
  * Fix softpatching failures when target has full stops (.) in filename.
  * Allow component directory redefinitions via environment variables.
  * Fix failure to restore performance counter option state between sessions.
  * Switch from using refresh rate to core FPS for calculating dropped frames.
  * Fix application crash when initializing illuminance sensor.
  * Extend X11 input driver with XInput2 extensions for multi-mouse use.
  * Apply color to the notification icon corresponding to message category.
  * Add visibility toggle for playlist tabs.
  * Guard nanosleep prototype behind _POSIX_TIMERS.
  * Enable display of non-PNG thumbnails in Qt interface.
  * Fix issue when replaying old format input recordings in newer versions.
  * Enable adaptive Vsync in Vulkan video driver.
  * Rewrite logic for finding ALSA audio devices in enumerate_audio_devices().
  * Debian package: Switch dependencies from linking Qt 5 libraries to Qt 6.

 -- Hunter Kaller <hunter_kaller@yahoo.com>  Mon, 28 Apr 2025 21:23:42 -0300

